        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>申论积累 —— 涵养\"自找苦吃\"的精气神</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 12px;\n    background: #ece0c4;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(rgba(200,180,140,0.25) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(200,180,140,0.25) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 14px 14px;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    border: 2px solid #7a1616;\n    background: #f3e9cd;\n    padding: 10px 14px 16px 14px;\n  }\n  /* header */\n  .top-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .badges {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 4px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n  }\n  .badge {\n    background: #8b1a1a;\n    color: #f5e6c8;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 4px 8px;\n    border: 1px solid #f5e6c8;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .masthead {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    padding: 6px 0;\n  }\n  .flag-icon {\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 20px;\n    background: #b8272c;\n    position: relative;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .masthead-text {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .masthead-sub {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #b8272c;\n    margin-left: 4px;\n  }\n  .legend {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 4px;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #333;\n    min-width: 90px;\n  }\n  .legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }\n  .legend-bar {\n    width: 24px; height: 8px; border-radius: 4px;\n  }\n  .bar-pink { background: #f2a7b3; }\n  .bar-blue { background: #a9c9e8; }\n  .bar-teal { background: #a3ded1; }\n\n  .title-bar {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    border-top: 3px double #7a1616;\n    border-bottom: 3px double #7a1616;\n    padding: 8px 0;\n    margin: 6px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n\n  .content {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n\n  .main-col {\n    flex: 3.2;\n    background: #f8f2e0;\n    border: 1px solid #b89a5e;\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    text-align: justify;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n\n  .main-col p {\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n  }\n\n  .num {\n    color: #1a4fa3;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  .box-green {\n    border: 1.4px solid #2e8b57;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n  }\n  .box-red {\n    border: 1.4px solid #c0392b;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n  }\n  .bold-red { color: #b8272c; font-weight: bold; }\n\n  .side-col {\n    flex: 1.15;\n    background: #e9c789;\n    border: 1px solid #a9822f;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .side-header {\n    background: #b8272c;\n    color: #fff;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    padding: 6px 0;\n  }\n  .side-body {\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .side-body .label {\n    color: #b8272c;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .side-body .num2 {\n    color: #1a4fa3;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .side-block {\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n    border-bottom: 1px dashed #a9822f;\n  }\n  .side-block:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"top-header\">\n    <div class=\"badges\">\n      <div class=\"badge\">申论</div>\n      <div class=\"badge\">积累</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"masthead\">\n      <div class=\"flag-icon\"></div>\n      <span class=\"masthead-text\">人民日报</span>\n      <span class=\"masthead-sub\">7.24文章精选</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"legend\">\n      <div class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"legend-bar bar-pink\"></span>论点</div>\n      <div class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"legend-bar bar-blue\"></span>论据</div>\n      <div class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"legend-bar bar-teal\"></span>对策</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"title-bar\">涵养\"自找苦吃\"的精气神</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <!-- 左侧正文 -->\n    <div class=\"main-col\">\n      <p><span class=\"num\">①</span>苦难成就辉煌，困难磨砺青春。\"你们在信中说，走进乡土中国深处，才深刻理解什么是实事求是、怎么去联系群众，青年人就要<span class=\"box-green\">\"自找苦吃\"</span>，说得很好。\"不久前，领导给中国农业大学科技小院的同学们回信，充分肯定同学们进走乡土中国深处\"自找苦吃\"的精神，强调\"新时代中国青年就应该有这股精气神\"</p>\n\n      <p><span class=\"num\">②</span>\"自找苦吃\"就是要敢于挑急难险重的担子，敢于到条件艰苦、<span class=\"box-green\">环境复杂的岗位锻炼</span>，在经历风大浪急、艰难困苦中磨炼意志、增长才干。青年人要成长成才，就要到更广阔的天地，更复杂的环境中去历练锻造，多经历一点摔打、挫折、考验，这样才能增益其所不能，练就担当的宽肩膀、成事的真本领。</p>\n\n      <p><span class=\"num\">③</span>肯吃苦、能吃苦，一代又一代中国青年茁壮成长的必经之路。犹记上世纪60年代，300名青年组成突击队，迎难而上，不怕牺牲\"硬骨头\"，将地势险要、石质坚硬的岩壁凿通，将红旗渠渠线延续了<span class=\"box-red\">最艰难的616米</span>。进入新时代，无论是逐梦星辰大海的年轻航天员，还是积极参与支教支边、用脚步丈量祖国大地的青年学生；无论是奋战在脱贫攻坚一线、用汗水和赤诚践行驻村第一书记的诺言，还是在边防一线为祖国奉献青春的95后、00后……无数青年不怕苦、不畏难，在\"自找苦吃\"中呈风尚、见世面。</p>\n\n      <p><span class=\"num\">④</span>梅花香自苦寒来。青年时代，选择吃苦也就选择了收获，选择奉献也就选择了高尚。有驻村第一书记坦言，基层工作艰苦、琐碎，但正是在全心全意为人民服务的过程中，自己找到了把所学知识转化为业务优势的切入点；科技小院的学生们\"自找苦吃\"，进村\"读研\"，为当地村民带来了无数的\"甜\"，也在摸爬滚打中练就了技艺。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 右侧摘要栏 -->\n    <div class=\"side-col\">\n      <div class=\"side-header\">话题：人生精神</div>\n      <div class=\"side-body\">\n        <div class=\"side-block\">\n          <div><span class=\"label\">总论点：</span>青年人就要\"自找苦吃\"</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"side-block\">\n          <div><span class=\"num2\">①</span><span class=\"label\">过渡段</span></div>\n          <div>\"自找苦吃\"就是要敢于挑急难险重的担子</div>\n          <div><span class=\"num2\">②</span><span class=\"label\">对策：</span>就要到更广阔的天地，更复杂的环境去历练锻造（论述自找苦吃的释义），对策）</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"side-block\">\n          <div><span class=\"num2\">①</span><span class=\"label\">分论点一：</span>能吃苦、能吃苦是代代青年茁壮成长的必经之路</div>\n          <div><span class=\"num2\">②</span><span class=\"label\">事例：</span>上世纪60年代：红旗渠年突击队，新时代：航天队伍、支教支边的青年学生，第一书记成战2线以做青年不怕苦、不畏难，在\"自找苦吃\"中呈风尚、见世面</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"side-block\">\n          <div><span class=\"num2\">①</span><span class=\"label\">分论点二：</span>选择吃苦也就选择了收获，选择奉献也就选择了高尚</div>\n          <div><span class=\"num2\">②</span><span class=\"label\">事例：</span>驻村第一书记：找到了把所学知识转化为业务优势的切入点；科技小院的学生们：在摸爬滚打中练就了技艺</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
